            <h3>The 80/20 Rule</h3>
            <p>Typically, 80% of your sales come from 20% of your products. Identify these fast movers. Ensure you <strong>never</strong> run out of stock on these items. They are what bring customers into your shop.</p>

            <h3>First-In, First-Out (FIFO)</h3>
            <p>This is crucial for perishables but applies to all stock. Ensure older stock is sold before newer shipments. Arrange your shelves so customers reach for the older items first, or rotate stock manually when restocking.</p>

